[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6664.629, "timestamp": "01:51:04", "text": "是的。是的。所以要时刻关注……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6668.87, "timestamp": "01:51:08", "text": "长椅。然后呃，就用你的空间刷屏吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6672.87, "timestamp": "01:51:12", "text": "向右走，然后向上走。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6675.669, "timestamp": "01:51:15", "text": "好的。情况很糟糕。你仍然可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6682.229, "timestamp": "01:51:22", "text": "也许这就是游戏持续进行的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6684.709, "timestamp": "01:51:24", "text": "崩溃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6686.79, "timestamp": "01:51:26", "text": "现在该怎么下去？你好吗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6692.07, "timestamp": "01:51:32", "text": "这？呃，到椅子上去坐下。垃圾邮件空间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6707.91, "timestamp": "01:51:47", "text": "哦，等等。不，不。好的。是的。瞧瞧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6711.109, "timestamp": "01:51:51", "text": "注意你的头要撞到……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6714.229, "timestamp": "01:51:54", "text": "天花板。不，看着。呃，你可以站着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6715.95, "timestamp": "01:51:55", "text": "观看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6719.669, "timestamp": "01:51:59", "text": "我，然后继续发垃圾邮件。我觉得很长一段时间都是这样。"}]